---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 标本索引
description: 按标签浏览 KUSARIUM 的图文记录。
permalink: /tags/index.html
---
<header class="page-intro shell page-intro--split">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">SPECIMEN INDEX</p>
    <h1>标本索引</h1>
  </div>
  <p>纸签上的名字不是界限，只是帮助我们再次找到它们。</p>
</header>

<nav class="tag-cloud shell" aria-label="标签快速导航">
  {% for topic in collections.topicList %}
    {% set topicPosts = collections.posts | filterByTopic(topic) %}
    <a href="#{{ topic | topicSlug }}"><span>#{{ topic }}</span><small>{{ topicPosts.length }}</small></a>
  {% endfor %}
</nav>

<section class="tag-index shell section">
  {% for topic in collections.topicList %}
    {% set topicPosts = collections.posts | filterByTopic(topic) %}
    <section class="tag-group" id="{{ topic | topicSlug }}">
      <header>
        <h2>#{{ topic }}</h2>
        <p>{{ topicPosts.length }} 枚记录</p>
      </header>
      <ol>
        {% for post in topicPosts %}
          <li>
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateIso }}">{{ post.date | dateReadable }}</time>
            <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
